@startuml class_core
!include common.iuml
title Optuna 5.0.0: основной путь\nУпрощение: только существенные для демо поля и методы
class Study {
  +sampler : BaseSampler
  -_storage : BaseStorage
  +ask() : Trial
  +tell(trial, value)
  +optimize(objective, n_trials)
}
class Trial {
  +study : Study
  +suggest_float(name, low, high)
  -_suggest(name, distribution)
  +relative_params
}
abstract class BaseSampler {
  +infer_relative_search_space(study, trial)
  +sample_relative(study, trial, search_space)
  +sample_independent(study, trial, name, distribution)
  +before_trial(study, trial)
  +after_trial(study, trial, state, values)
}
abstract class BaseStorage {
  +create_new_trial(study_id)
  +set_trial_param(...)
  +set_trial_state_values(...)
}
class InMemoryStorage
class FrozenTrial {
  +params
  +distributions
  +value
  +state
}
Study o--> BaseSampler : стратегия
Study o--> BaseStorage
Study ..> Trial : создаёт
Trial --> Study
Trial ..> BaseSampler : через study.sampler
Trial ..> BaseStorage : сохраняет значения
BaseStorage <|-- InMemoryStorage
BaseSampler ..> FrozenTrial : сведения о попытке
@enduml
